+ chown -R 10000:10000 /home/alice
+ chmod 700 /home/alice
+ chown -R 10001:10001 /home/bob
+ chmod 700 /home/bob
prigh-docker: /workspace/bob is from an older image: users now work in their homes and nothing uses /workspace. Move it: docker compose exec prigh sh -c 'cp -a /workspace/bob/. /home/bob/ && chown -R bob: /home/bob', then remove the /workspace mount (see DOCKER.md, Migrating from /workspace)
